Docker Compose secrets (one value per file, no trailing newline required).

Create from `.env`:

    ../scripts/prepare-docker-secrets.sh

Or manually:

    mkdir -p secrets
    printf '%s' "$DB_PWD" > secrets/db_password
    printf '%s' "$HF_TOKEN" > secrets/hf_token
    printf '%s' "$QDRANT_API_KEY" > secrets/qdrant_api_key

Files are mounted at `/run/secrets/<name>` inside containers.
Do not commit real secret files.
